@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
autonumber
title SB-M16 — Conditional isolated restoration and safe reconciliation
actor Operator as U
participant "Recovery record / coverage" as B
participant "Restoration assessment" as R
participant "Current access context" as A
participant "External-effect state" as X
U -> B : Identify intended recovery point / scenario / covered sources
B -> B : Check authority, actual material and isolated drill conditions
alt Required source, authority or safe environment absent
 B --> U : Blocked; no restoration claim
else Future authorized isolated drill
 B -> R : Restore covered candidate information in isolation
 R -> R : Check integrity, references and workflow consistency
 R -> A : Reconcile current access / deletion decisions
 A --> R : Safe / unresolved access findings
 R -> X : Reconcile provider / run / reminder / target effects
 X --> R : Confirmed disposition or unresolved uncertainty
 alt Usable state demonstrated against defined criteria
  R --> U : Actual bounded results and measured target comparison
 else Incomplete, failed or uncertain recovery
  R --> U : Actual limitations; no recovery Pass
 end
end
note over B,X
No live restore is performed by this model.
Do not reopen revoked grants or blindly replay sends / deployments.
end note
legend bottom
Logical domain interaction, not runtime execution evidence.
Detailed proposed guards/policies retain their primary status.
endlegend
@enduml
